Víceřádkové konstrukce
**********************

.[perex]
Sekce `multiline` rozhoduje o konstrukcích rozepsaných na víc řádků: signatuře, volání, poli, podmínce, řetězu volání, ternárním operátoru a dalších, o tom, jak se rozloží příliš široký řádek, kam se při zalomení řádku dává operátor, a o čárce za poslední položkou víceřádkového seznamu.

Konstrukce je rozepsaná, když se v ní láme řádek, ať ji tak napsal autor, nebo ji zlomila šířka řádku. Jak rozepsaná konstrukce stojí, říká klíč pojmenovaný po ní: `signature`, `call`, `array`, `condition`, `chain`, `ternary`, `for`, `binaryOperator` a `implements`. Hodnota `perLine` pak dá každé položce vlastní řádek a závorkám taky; PER Coding Style to chce u signatury, volání, podmínky, řetězu i pole. A každé místo, kde stojí seznam, má vlastní klíč pro čárku na konci: pole, argumenty, parametry, větve `match`, `use` u closure, skupinový import a `list()`.

```neon
multiline:
	signature: perLine
	call: perLine
	array: perLine
	condition: perLine
	operatorPosition:
		condition: lineStart
	trailingComma:
		parameter: required
		argument: required
		array: required
```

```php .[before]
class Cart
{
	public function __construct(private Clock $clock,  // Expected a line break before the parameter, because the signature spans several lines.
		private Logger $logger, private Tax $tax)  // A multi-line parameter list must end with a trailing comma.
	{
	}

	public function add(string $name, int $count): void
	{
		$this->logger->log('added', [
			'name' => $name, 'count' => $count,  // Expected a line break before the array item, because the array spans several lines.
			'time' => $this->clock->now()]);  // A multi-line array must end with a trailing comma.
		if ($count > 10 &&  // Expected a line break before the expression, because the condition is not in the `perLine` shape.
			$name !== '') {
			$this->tax->apply($name,  // Expected a line break before the argument, because the arguments span several lines.
				$count);  // A multi-line argument list must end with a trailing comma.
		}
	}
}
```

```php .[after]
class Cart
{
	public function __construct(
		private Clock $clock,
		private Logger $logger,
		private Tax $tax,
	)
	{
	}

	public function add(string $name, int $count): void
	{
		$this->logger->log('added', [
			'name' => $name,
			'count' => $count,
			'time' => $this->clock->now(),
		]);
		if (
			$count > 10
			&& $name !== ''
		) {
			$this->tax->apply(
				$name,
				$count,
			);
		}
	}
}
```

Ukázka nastavuje jen sekci `multiline`, a proto `{` konstruktoru zůstala, kde byla; kam patří, rozhoduje [`braces.position.multilineSignature` |braces#braces.position.multilineSignature]. Jak se odsadí řádky, které rozepsáním vzniknou, říká sekce [indentation |indentation].


Příliš široký řádek
===================

Tvar konstrukce je zároveň spínač: konstrukce, jejíž klíč není `keep`, se rozloží do svého tvaru i tehdy, když ji autor napsal na jeden řádek, ale řádek je širší než [`file.lineLength` |file#file.lineLength]. Měří se kód řádku, komentář za ním se nepočítá. Láme se zvenku dovnitř: napřed vnější konstrukce, a vnitřní se pak měří na řádku, kde zůstala. Délka je tu kvůli místu na stránce snížená na 60 znaků:

```neon
file:
	lineLength: 60
multiline:
	call: perLine
```

```php .[before]
$order = $this->orders->create($customer, new Address($street, $city), $items);  // Expected a line break before the argument, because the line is 79 characters long, more than 60.
throw new InvalidArgumentException("Customer $customer->name has no address.");
$this->mailer->send($order->customer->email, $order->invoice); // a copy goes to accounting
```

```php .[after]
$order = $this->orders->create(
	$customer,
	new Address($street, $city),
	$items
);
throw new InvalidArgumentException("Customer $customer->name has no address.");
$this->mailer->send($order->customer->email, $order->invoice); // a copy goes to accounting
```

Volání `create()` je vnější, a tak se rozložilo první; `new Address(...)` se pak na svůj řádek vešlo a zůstalo celé. Celá zůstala i hláška výjimky: volání nebo `new`, jehož jediným argumentem je řetězec, i spojený s dalším výrazem, se podle šířky neláme. A celý zůstal řádek s komentářem za kódem, protože komentář by po rozložení zůstal na posledním řádku, daleko od kódu, o kterém mluví, a `dresscode:ignore` by přestal umlčovat řádek, ke kterému patří. Stejně zůstává řádek, který otevírá text (konec heredocu, HTML), klíč v hranatých závorkách přístupu do pole a konstrukce, za kterou je zbytek řádku sám širší než limit, protože ten by zůstal na jejím posledním řádku a pořád by se nevešel. Když na řádku stojí dvě konstrukce, které žádná společná nedrží, třeba klíč a hodnota přiřazení do prvku pole nebo podmínka a výsledek větve `match`, láme se napřed ta vpravo.

Co zalomit nejde, třeba dlouhý řetězec, nahlásí [`file.longLines` |file#file.longLines]. Které konstrukce nechat i na příliš širokém řádku být, říká [`file.lineLengthExcept` |file#file.lineLengthExcept]: druh v seznamu (`call`, `array`, `chain`…) se podle šířky neláme a jeho řádek se nehlásí. Řádek dlouhý jen kvůli řetězcům z hlášení vynechá slovo `strings`. Konstrukci napsanou na jednom řádku rozloží i bez ohledu na šířku řádku `arrayMaxWidth`, když je pole širší než daný počet znaků, a `signaturePromoted`, když signatura deklaruje vlastnost v konstruktoru.


Čárka na konci seznamu
======================

Čárka za poslední položkou víceřádkového seznamu má praktický důvod: přidání další položky změní v diffu jeden řádek, ne dva. U `required` rozhoduje zavírací závorka: když stojí na vlastním řádku, čárka tam patří, když stojí na řádku poslední položky, čárka tam být nesmí. `optional` ji nechá na autorovi, `forbidden` ji odstraní. Ze seznamu na jednom řádku se čárka odstraní při každé z těch tří hodnot, jen `keep` nechá daný druh seznamu úplně být.

```neon
multiline:
	trailingComma:
		array: required
```

```php .[before]
$colors = [
	'red',
	'green'
];  // A multi-line array must end with a trailing comma.

$sizes = ['S', 'M', 'L',];  // A one-line list must not end with a trailing comma.

$matrix = [
	[1, 2],
	[3, 4],];  // A trailing comma must not precede a closing bracket on the line of the last item.
```

```php .[after]
$colors = [
	'red',
	'green',
];

$sizes = ['S', 'M', 'L'];

$matrix = [
	[1, 2],
	[3, 4]];
```

Poslední případ ukazuje, kdo rozhoduje: pole je rozepsané na řádky, ale jeho zavírací závorka stojí na řádku poslední položky, takže tam čárka nepatří. Přesunout závorku na vlastní řádek je práce klíče `multiline.array`; teprve pak sem čárka přijde.


multiline.array
===============

The items of an array spread over lines, by its author or for its width, the opening bracket staying on the line of the code before it.

- `perLine`: every item on a line of its own and the closing bracket on a line of its own
- `asWritten`: the items stand as their author spread them and the closing bracket begins a line where the first item does
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `perLine`, psr12 `keep`, nette `asWritten`, symfony `keep` .[decision-facts]

Pole aspoň o dvou položkách se rozloží, když se nevejde jeho řádek; šířku pole samotného od závorky k závorce k tomu přidává `multiline.arrayMaxWidth`. `file.lineLengthExcept: [array]` vypne jen to první.

```neon
file:
	lineLength: 60
multiline:
	array: perLine
```

```php .[before]
$row = ['id' => $order->id, 'total' => $order->total, 'paid' => $order->paidAt];  // Expected a line break before the array item, because the line is 80 characters long, more than 60.
```

```php .[after]
$row = [
	'id' => $order->id,
	'total' => $order->total,
	'paid' => $order->paidAt
];
```


multiline.arrayMaxWidth
=======================

The width from bracket to bracket over which an array of several items written on one line is spread over lines, more than five items filling its lines where `multiline.array` is `asWritten`.

- počet od 1
- `none`: never spread for its width

Výchozí `none` · standardy: perCs `none`, psr12 `none`, nette `130`, symfony `none` .[decision-facts]


multiline.trailingComma.array
=============================

The trailing comma of a multi-line array, a destructuring written with `[...]` included; any value but `keep` also removes the one a list written on one line has.

- `required`: there where the closing bracket stands on its own line, never where it follows the last item
- `forbidden`: never there
- `optional`: as the author wrote it where the closing bracket stands on its own line, never where it follows the last item
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `required`, psr12 `keep`, nette `required`, symfony `required` · pokrývá `no_trailing_comma_in_singleline`, `trailing_comma_in_multiline`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.Arrays.TrailingArrayComma` .[decision-facts]


multiline.trailingComma.argument
================================

The trailing comma of the multi-line arguments of a call and the variables of `isset()` and `unset()`; any value but `keep` also removes the one a list written on one line has.

- `required`: there where the closing bracket stands on its own line, never where it follows the last item
- `forbidden`: never there
- `optional`: as the author wrote it where the closing bracket stands on its own line, never where it follows the last item
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `required`, psr12 `keep`, nette `required`, symfony `optional` · pokrývá `no_trailing_comma_in_singleline`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.Functions.RequireTrailingCommaInCall` .[decision-facts]

```neon
multiline:
	trailingComma:
		argument: required
```

```php .[before]
mail(
	$to,
	$subject
);  // A multi-line argument list must end with a trailing comma.
```

```php .[after]
mail(
	$to,
	$subject,
);
```


multiline.trailingComma.parameter
=================================

The trailing comma of a multi-line list of parameters; any value but `keep` also removes the one a list written on one line has.

- `required`: there where the closing bracket stands on its own line, never where it follows the last item
- `forbidden`: never there
- `optional`: as the author wrote it where the closing bracket stands on its own line, never where it follows the last item
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `required`, psr12 `keep`, nette `required`, symfony `required` · pokrývá `function_declaration`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.Functions.RequireTrailingCommaInDeclaration` .[decision-facts]


multiline.trailingComma.matchArm
================================

The trailing comma of the arms of a multi-line `match`; any value but `keep` also removes the one a list written on one line has.

- `required`: there where the closing bracket stands on its own line, never where it follows the last item
- `forbidden`: never there
- `optional`: as the author wrote it where the closing bracket stands on its own line, never where it follows the last item
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `required`, psr12 `keep`, nette `keep`, symfony `required` .[decision-facts]


multiline.trailingComma.closureUse
==================================

The trailing comma of a multi-line `use` of a closure; any value but `keep` also removes the one a list written on one line has.

- `required`: there where the closing bracket stands on its own line, never where it follows the last item
- `forbidden`: never there
- `optional`: as the author wrote it where the closing bracket stands on its own line, never where it follows the last item
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `required`, psr12 `keep`, nette `keep`, symfony `keep` .[decision-facts]


multiline.trailingComma.import
==============================

The trailing comma of the names of a multi-line group use; any value but `keep` also removes the one a list written on one line has.

- `required`: there where the closing bracket stands on its own line, never where it follows the last item
- `forbidden`: never there
- `optional`: as the author wrote it where the closing bracket stands on its own line, never where it follows the last item
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `optional`, psr12 `keep`, nette `optional`, symfony `optional` · pokrývá `no_trailing_comma_in_singleline` .[decision-facts]


multiline.trailingComma.list
============================

The trailing comma of a `list()`, whose only effect is that any value but `keep` removes the one a `list()` written on one line has or one followed by the closing parenthesis, a multi-line one otherwise staying as written.

- `optional`: as the author wrote it
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `optional`, psr12 `keep`, nette `optional`, symfony `optional` · pokrývá `no_trailing_comma_in_singleline` .[decision-facts]


multiline.implements
====================

The interfaces a class or an enum implements, or an interface extends, spread over lines by their author or for the width of their line.

- `perLine`: every interface on a line of its own, the first on the line after the keyword
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `perLine`, psr12 `perLine`, nette `perLine`, symfony `keep` .[decision-facts]

Podle šířky řádku se rozloží seznam aspoň dvou rozhraní, za `implements` i za `extends` rozhraní:

```neon
file:
	lineLength: 60
multiline:
	implements: perLine
```

```php .[before]
class OrderCollection implements Countable, IteratorAggregate, JsonSerializable  // Expected a line break before the name, because the line is 79 characters long, more than 60.
{
}
```

```php .[after]
class OrderCollection implements
	Countable,
	IteratorAggregate,
	JsonSerializable
{
}
```


multiline.condition
===================

The shape of a condition of `if`, `elseif`, `while` and `do-while` joined by boolean operators that stands on several lines or on one too wide, the closing parenthesis on a line of its own; one in no shape that passes is written again in the first, a line per part beginning with its operator.

- `perLine`: begins on the line after the opening parenthesis
- `compact`: begins on the line of the opening parenthesis
- seznam těchto slov, kde projde každé a kód, který neodpovídá žádnému, se napíše podle prvního
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `perLine`, psr12 `perLine`, nette `[perLine, compact]`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `PSR12.ControlStructures.ControlStructureSpacing`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.ControlStructures.RequireMultiLineCondition` .[decision-facts]

Podmínka napsaná na jednom řádku se rozloží, když je kód jejího řádku širší než `file.lineLength`. Komentář za kódem se do šířky nepočítá, a proto druhá podmínka zůstane, jak je:

```neon
file:
	lineLength: 60
multiline:
	condition: perLine
```

```php .[before]
if ($order->isPaid() && $order->isShipped() && !$order->isReturned()) {  // Expected a line break before the expression, because the line is 71 characters long, more than 60.
	archive($order);
}
if ($order->isPaid() && $order->isShipped()) { // kept for a year
	archive($order);
}
```

```php .[after]
if (
	$order->isPaid()
	&& $order->isShipped()
	&& !$order->isReturned()
) {
	archive($order);
}
if ($order->isPaid() && $order->isShipped()) { // kept for a year
	archive($order);
}
```

Nette Coding Standard připouští oba tvary, podmínku začínající na dalším řádku i tu, která začíná hned za závorkou:

```neon
multiline:
	condition: [perLine, compact]
```

```php .[before]
if ($order->isPaid()
	&& $order->isShipped()
) {
	archive($order);
}

if (
	$order->isPaid()
	&& $order->isShipped()
) {
	archive($order);
}
```


multiline.operatorPosition.condition
====================================

Where a boolean operator chaining a condition of `if`, `elseif`, `while` and `do-while` stands at a line break.

- `lineStart`: one ending a line opens the next, unless a comment follows it
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `lineStart`, psr12 `lineStart`, nette `lineStart`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `PSR12.ControlStructures.BooleanOperatorPlacement` .[decision-facts]


multiline.for
=============

The sections of the header of a `for` spread over lines by its author or for the width of its line, the closing parenthesis then standing on a line of its own.

- `perLine`: every section on a line of its own
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `perLine`, psr12 `perLine`, nette `perLine`, symfony `keep` .[decision-facts]

```neon
file:
	lineLength: 60
multiline:
	for: perLine
```

```php .[before]
for ($i = 0, $count = count($this->items); $i < $count; $i++) {  // Expected a line break after the opening parenthesis, because the line is 63 characters long, more than 60.
}
```

```php .[after]
for (
	$i = 0, $count = count($this->items);
	$i < $count;
	$i++
) {
}
```


multiline.operatorPosition.binary
=================================

Where a binary operator other than `.` stands at a line break, a boolean operator chaining a condition apart: a comparison, `&`, `^` or a shift moves only where the line joined after it would be too wide.

- `lineStart`: one ending a line opens the next, unless a comment follows it
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `lineStart`, psr12 `lineStart`, nette `lineStart`, symfony `keep` .[decision-facts]


multiline.operatorPosition.concatenation
========================================

Where the concatenation operator stands at a line break.

- `lineStart`: one ending a line opens the next, unless a comment follows it
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `lineStart`, psr12 `keep`, nette `lineStart`, symfony `keep` .[decision-facts]


multiline.binaryOperator
========================

The operands of `&&`, `||`, `and`, `or`, `xor`, `.` and `|` on a line wider than the line length, outside a condition.

A family its author spread over lines stays as it is.

- `perLine`: every operand on a line of its own, the operator opening it
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `perLine`, psr12 `perLine`, nette `perLine`, symfony `keep` .[decision-facts]

Rozkládá se celá rodina operátorů naráz. Závorky nebo jiný z těch operátorů začínají rodinu vnitřní, která se rozloží, až když se nevejde ani na svůj řádek. Aritmetika, porovnání a `??` se podle šířky nelámou. Podmínku `if` a `while` rozkládá `multiline.condition`.

```neon
file:
	lineLength: 60
multiline:
	binaryOperator: perLine
```

```php .[before]
$visible = $user->isAdmin() || ($order->isPaid() && $order->ownerId === $user->id);  // Expected a line break before the `||` operator, because the line is 83 characters long, more than 60.
$total = $order->subtotal + $order->shipping + $order->tax - $order->discountAmount;
```

```php .[after]
$visible = $user->isAdmin()
	|| ($order->isPaid() && $order->ownerId === $user->id);
$total = $order->subtotal + $order->shipping + $order->tax - $order->discountAmount;
```


multiline.matchArmConditions
============================

The conditions of a `match` arm spread over lines by their author or for the width of their line.

- `perLine`: every condition on a line of its own, `=>` after the last one
- `asWritten`: the conditions stand as their author spread them and more than five spread for the width fill the lines, `=>` after the last one
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `perLine`, psr12 `perLine`, nette `asWritten`, symfony `keep` .[decision-facts]

Podmínky větve stojí po jedné na řádku se stejným odsazením jako větev a `=>` s výsledkem následuje za poslední; větev s jedinou podmínkou zůstane:

```neon
file:
	lineLength: 60
multiline:
	matchArmConditions: perLine
```

```php .[before]
$kind = match (true) {
	$node instanceof FunctionNode, $node instanceof MethodNode => 'function',  // Expected a line break before the expression, because the line is 77 characters long, more than 60.
	default => null,
};
```

```php .[after]
$kind = match (true) {
	$node instanceof FunctionNode,
	$node instanceof MethodNode => 'function',
	default => null,
};
```


multiline.chain
===============

The links of a chain of method calls and property accesses spread over lines by its author, or for the width of its line where it has two method calls or more.

- `perLine`: every link on a line of its own
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `perLine`, psr12 `keep`, nette `perLine`, symfony `keep` .[decision-facts]

Podle šířky se rozloží jen řetěz aspoň dvou volání metod; `$this->customer->getAddress()->city` zůstane celý. Kde stojí články před prvním zalomeným, říká `multiline.chainFirstLinks`.

```neon
file:
	lineLength: 60
multiline:
	chain: perLine
```

```php .[before]
$orders = $repository->findPaid()->sortBy('date')->limit(10)->toArray();  // Expected a line break before the object operator, because the line is 72 characters long, more than 60.
```

```php .[after]
$orders = $repository
	->findPaid()
	->sortBy('date')
	->limit(10)
	->toArray();
```


multiline.chainFirstLinks
=========================

Where the links stand that come before the first one beginning a line.

- `ownLine`: the first link begins a line too
- `sameLine`: the links before the first one beginning a line stay on the line the chain starts on

Výchozí `ownLine` · standardy: perCs `ownLine`, psr12 `ownLine`, nette `sameLine`, symfony `ownLine` .[decision-facts]


multiline.ternary
=================

A ternary spread over lines by its author, or for the width of its line.

- `perLine`: `?` and `:` each opening a line of its own
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `perLine`, psr12 `keep`, nette `perLine`, symfony `keep` .[decision-facts]

```neon
file:
	lineLength: 60
multiline:
	ternary: perLine
```

```php .[before]
$label = $order->isPaid() ? $this->formatDate($order->paidAt) : 'unpaid';  // Expected a line break before the `?` operator, because the line is 73 characters long, more than 60.
```

```php .[after]
$label = $order->isPaid()
	? $this->formatDate($order->paidAt)
	: 'unpaid';
```


multiline.operatorPosition.ternary
==================================

Where `?`, `:` and `?:` of a ternary stand at a line break.

- `lineStart`: one ending a line opens the next, unless a comment follows it
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `lineStart`, psr12 `keep`, nette `lineStart`, symfony `keep` .[decision-facts]


multiline.call
==============

The arguments of a call, of `new` or of an attribute spread over lines by its author, which is one where an argument or the closing parenthesis begins a line, or for the width of its line, the closing parenthesis then standing on a line of its own and each comma on the line of its argument.

A sole argument that is a string, a message, is not spread for its width.

- `perLine`: every argument on a line of its own
- `frame`: only the parentheses on lines of their own
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `perLine`, psr12 `perLine`, nette `perLine`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `method_argument_space`, `PSR2.Methods.FunctionCallSignature` .[decision-facts]

Hodnota `frame` dá na příliš širokém řádku na vlastní řádky jen závorky a argumenty nechá pohromadě:

```neon
file:
	lineLength: 60
multiline:
	call: frame
```

```php .[before]
$invoice = $this->invoices->create($order, $customer, $dueDate);  // Expected a line break before the argument, because the line is 64 characters long, more than 60.
```

```php .[after]
$invoice = $this->invoices->create(
	$order, $customer, $dueDate
);
```


multiline.callSoleArgument
==========================

Where a call too wide whose sole argument is a call, `new` or an array keeps it.

- `hugged`: a sole argument that is a call, `new` or an array spreads in the parentheses, `foo(bar(` and `))` together
- `ownLine`: a sole argument takes a line of its own as any argument

Výchozí `ownLine` · standardy: perCs `ownLine`, psr12 `ownLine`, nette `hugged`, symfony `ownLine` .[decision-facts]

Objímá se jen jediný argument; volání s víc argumenty se rozloží jako každé jiné:

```neon
file:
	lineLength: 60
multiline:
	call: perLine
	callSoleArgument: hugged
```

```php .[before]
throw new InvalidOrder(sprintf('Order %d cannot be shipped.', $id));  // Expected a line break before the argument, because the line is 68 characters long, more than 60.
$this->logger->info(sprintf('Order %d shipped.', $id), ['id' => $id]);  // Expected a line break before the argument, because the line is 70 characters long, more than 60.
```

```php .[after]
throw new InvalidOrder(sprintf(
	'Order %d cannot be shipped.',
	$id
));
$this->logger->info(
	sprintf('Order %d shipped.', $id),
	['id' => $id]
);
```


multiline.signature
===================

The parameters of a signature spread over lines by its author or for its width, or with a parameter whose hooks span lines, each comma on the line of its parameter and the closing parenthesis on the next.

- `perLine`: every parameter on a line of its own
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `perLine`, psr12 `perLine`, nette `perLine`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `SlevomatCodingStandard.Classes.RequireMultiLineMethodSignature`, `Squiz.Functions.MultiLineFunctionDeclaration` .[decision-facts]

```neon
file:
	lineLength: 60
multiline:
	signature: perLine
```

```php .[before]
class Shipping
{
	public function ship(Order $order, Address $address, bool $express): void  // Expected a line break before the parameter, because the line is 77 characters long, more than 60.
	{
	}
}
```

```php .[after]
class Shipping
{
	public function ship(
		Order $order,
		Address $address,
		bool $express
	): void
	{
	}
}
```


multiline.signaturePromoted
===========================

When a signature declaring a promoted property is spread over lines.

- `always`: spread over lines whatever its width
- `asSignature`: spread only when its line is too wide, as any signature

Výchozí `always` · standardy: perCs `asSignature`, psr12 `asSignature`, nette `always`, symfony `asSignature` · pokrývá `multiline_promoted_properties`, `SlevomatCodingStandard.Classes.RequireMultiLineMethodSignature` .[decision-facts]

Rozkládá se do tvaru, který dává `multiline.signature`. Hodnota `always` rozloží i krátký konstruktor, který deklaruje vlastnost (promoted property):

```neon
multiline:
	signature: perLine
	signaturePromoted: always
```

```php .[before]
class Shipping
{
	public function __construct(private Carrier $carrier)  // Expected a line break before the parameter, because the signature declares a promoted property.
	{
	}
}
```

```php .[after]
class Shipping
{
	public function __construct(
		private Carrier $carrier
	)
	{
	}
}
```


multiline.groupUse
==================

When a group use written on one line is spread over lines.

- `overMaxLength`: spread over lines where its line is longer than the maximum, its names filling them
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `keep`, symfony `keep` .[decision-facts]


multiline.attributes.declaration
================================

The attributes of a class, a function, a method, a property, a constant, a case of an enum or a hook of a property whose hooks span lines stand right above it, no blank line between the groups; those of a closure, an anonymous class or a hook in hooks written on one line may share its line.

- `ownLines`: every group on a line of its own above the declaration
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `ownLines`, psr12 `keep`, nette `ownLines`, symfony `ownLines` · pokrývá `SlevomatCodingStandard.Attributes.DisallowMultipleAttributesPerLine` .[decision-facts]


multiline.attributes.parameter
==============================

Where the attributes of a parameter stand.

- `ownLines`: every group on a line of its own in a list of parameters spread over lines, on the line of the parameter in a list on one line
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `ownLines`, psr12 `keep`, nette `ownLines`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `SlevomatCodingStandard.Attributes.DisallowMultipleAttributesPerLine` .[decision-facts]


multiline.expressionBelowReturn
===============================

An expression spanning several lines begins on the line of `return`, `throw`, `yield`, `print` or `echo`.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `warning`: as `forbidden`, its violations only warning
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `keep` .[decision-facts]


multiline.semicolonOnOwnLine
============================

A semicolon standing on a line of its own below a statement spanning several lines, instead of closing its last line.

- `forbidden`: never there
- `warning`: as `forbidden`, its violations only warning
- `keep`: nic se nevynucuje, kód zůstane, jak je

Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `keep` · pokrývá `Squiz.WhiteSpace.SemicolonSpacing` .[decision-facts]
